====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To fall apart into shards, usually as the result of impact or explosion.
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To break (something) into shards.
# {{context|online role-playing|transitive|lang=en}} To divide (an [[MMORPG]]) into several [[#Noun|shards]], or to establish a shard of one.

